commits.message:
cps-tools: improvements in commands and output messages

- reordered the commands of each service in a more logical manner, with help always the last command;
- storage volume commands appear only for the generic service (the only one that supports them at the moment);
- renamed 'get_config' to 'get

cps-tools, managers: better checking and management of node roles

- node roles are defined as constants in each service manager class and the constants are used throughout the class instead of unnamed literals;
- each service manager exposes a list of roles it accepts using the 'get_node_roles()';

